  "description": "Art of Nature I is a fresh and refined fragrance that blends bright citrus with green aromatic notes and a smooth woody base. The scent feels natural, clean, and uplifting, offering a modern interpretation of nature-inspired freshness. The opening introduces vibrant citrus notes with a green, slightly herbal touch, creating a crisp and refreshing first impression. The heart develops into aromatic and green accords that add depth, balance, and a clean, earthy sophistication. The base settles into woody notes and soft musk, leaving a smooth, airy, and long-lasting trail. Art of Nature I is perfect for those who enjoy fresh, green fragrances with a natural citrus brightness and a subtle woody finish.",
